            <ArticleTitle>[Angina accelerated under betablockers].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>99-101</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>An observation of angina aggravated in a concomitant manner with the introduction of treatment with beta blockers is reported. The exacerbation of a vasospastic component with this treatment is evoked on clinical, electrical and coronarographic grounds.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
